# What does NOT go into the distributed plugin.
#
# This file answers by EXCLUSION rather than by listing what ships, and that is the whole point:
# an enumerated ship list silently omits the next file somebody adds, while an exclusion list
# fails in the safe direction -- a forgotten entry ships something harmless, not a plugin missing
# a class. tools/build-zip.sh reads this, and asserts afterwards that every PHP file lichtbild-gallery.php
# requires is present in the archive.
#
# The distributed plugin is: lichtbild-gallery.php, uninstall.php, readme.txt, LICENSE, and the
# includes/ assets/ blocks/ languages/ directories. Everything below is development apparatus.

# Version control and CI
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github
.githooks
.distignore

# The engineering record. readme.txt is the user-facing documentation; these are not.
AGENTS.md
AGENTS.local.md
CLAUDE.md
CHANGELOG.md
TODO.md
README.md
docs

# Test harness and the fixtures it runs on -- 6.4 MB, none of it reachable at runtime.
tests

# Deployment, the local WordPress builder, and the live-site enumerator.
tools

# Listing images. These belong in SVN under assets/ at the repository root, which is NOT the
# plugin's own assets/ directory and must never be confused with it: anything placed here would
# otherwise be downloaded by every user for no reason.
.wordpress-org

# Deploy scratch, regenerated per release.
urls.txt
*.tsv

# The compiled German catalogue. It stays in the repository and it still goes to the site this
# plugin was built for -- it is only the wordpress.org PACKAGE it must not be in.
#
# Plugins hosted on the directory get their translations from translate.wordpress.org, delivered
# into WP_LANG_DIR/plugins/, so a bundled .po/.mo is at best dead weight and at worst a copy that
# silently overrides the community's. Shipping one is what the directory asked us to stop doing.
#
# languages/lichtbild-gallery.pot is deliberately NOT excluded: a template is not a translation. It is what
# a translator starts from, and tests/i18n-test.php compares it against the source on every run.
languages/lichtbild-gallery-de_DE.po
languages/lichtbild-gallery-de_DE.mo

# Agent instruction directories. Plugin Check raises an ERROR on these by name, and the build
# stages from `git archive` so an untracked one cannot reach the zip anyway -- listed so the
# intent survives a change of staging method.
.claude
.cursor
.aider*

# Build output, including previously built archives: Plugin Check rejects a plugin that contains
# a compressed file.
build

# Editor and OS debris
.DS_Store
.vscode
.idea
node_modules
*.log
